# tier 3's reference set for the cullet-mono variants (t3_fonts.py): Cullet
# Mono Regular alone, with no layer, so the font helper draws Cullet Mono's
# own glyph for each character the font holds. The case switches the console
# to it with vtium-config use-frit and compares the probes Cullet Mono draws
# in cullet-mono with the same probes drawn here.
